---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this licence
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MIT licence above covers the source code in src/, scripts/, experiments/
and synthetic/ only.

The network data under data/graphs/ and data/osm/ are derived from
OpenStreetMap and are distributed under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
not under the MIT licence.  See NOTICE for the attribution that must be kept.

The trajectory bundles under data/samples/ and synthetic/ contain no
operational record: data/samples/ holds a small redacted subset of the
measurements with the operational metadata removed, and synthetic/ holds
generated data.  They are provided for demonstration and smoke testing and
come with no warranty of any kind.
